OL,3,AGreen Party's 'Zionism is racism'
OL,4,Amotion will not be overturned, Zack
OL,5,APolanski tells Kuenssberg
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper says
OL,8,Fchildren should not be being treated in
OL,9,Fhospital corridors and that an "urgent
OL,10,Fplan" is needed to tackle the issue -
OL,11,Fwatch live above
OL,13,FSpeaking on Sunday with Laura
OL,14,FKuenssberg, Cooper says "nobody should
OL,15,Fbe being treated in corridors" and
OL,16,Funveils 14 urgent treatment centres to
OL,17,Ftackle the issue
OL,19,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski also
OL,20,Ffaced questions about his party's
OL,21,Fdecision to pass a motion declaring
OL,22,FZionism is a form of racism
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
